    <sys:String x:Key="Browser_InvalidIdentity">Application IDs must be valid and unique. Restore the configuration backup if an identity was edited.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Browser_JournalUnavailable">The browser ownership journal cannot be read. Restore its backup before using websites; automatic creation is disabled.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Browser_FocusDenied">The website tab exists, but its window could not be brought forward. Select the browser window or retry. No additional tab was opened.</sys:String>
