    <sys:String x:Key="Browser_KioskUnsupported">Website entries require a separately restricted browser deployment and cannot be used with AppSwitcher kiosk enforcement.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Browser_PlacementUnsupported">Website tabs share browser windows. Disable native window placement, monitor and always-on-top policies for website entries.</sys:String>
